{
  "_about": "The nature makeover (docs/runbooks/nature.md): frame time with and without the designed ground (campground, the heaviest), and close and low looks by kind: rills and fans on a hill, woodland floor, deadwood and log moss from under the trees at a glade edge, marsh hollows in the reed marsh, the lake country shores. Send with: powershell -File tools/suite/Send-Suite.ps1 -File suite/scenarios/ground-nature.json -Who makeover-nature",
